### Additional comments

This was actually raised back in 2016 in #7192, where @mysticatea confirmed the inconsistency and said "I think we can expand the support to function expressions and arrows". It was marked as an enhancement, but was closed after 21 days without reaching consensus. I'm happy to pick it up.

