##### TypeScript: Fix comments being dropped on shorthand `type` import/export specifiers ([#&#8203;19565](https://redirect.github.com/prettier/prettier/pull/19565) by [@&#8203;kirkwaiblinger](https://redirect.github.com/kirkwaiblinger))

